  "goodToKnow": "Die Laufbahn is a career, especially a structured one: die berufliche Laufbahn, die Beamtenlaufbahn (civil service career, with fixed grades). Eine Laufbahn einschlagen means to embark on a career. Literally, it's a running track: die Bahn (track) where one läuft (runs), and athletics stadiums have a Laufbahn too. Don't confuse it with der Lebenslauf, the CV you send with a job application. Synonym: die Karriere."
